s","news":[{"headline":"No. 4 Notre Dame rules out LB Drayk Bowen (ankle) vs. No. 1 Miami","description":"Notre Dame captain and starting linebacker Drayk Bowen will miss Saturday's big showdown against top-ranked Miami with a right ankle injury.","published":"2026-11-02T19:00:04.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50359851/no-4-notre-dame-rules-lb-drayk-bowen-vs-no-1-miami","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Defiant Dabo Swinney says Clemson's 'gonna win a bunch more'","description":"Despite going through a self-described \"rough patch\" over the past two seasons, Clemson coach Dabo Swinney is resolute in his belief that he and the Tigers have a lot more wins ahead of them.","published":"2026-11-17T19:48:29.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512833/defiant-dabo-swinney-says-clemson-gonna-win-bunch-more","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Army OC Cody Worley to be Furman head coach","description":"Army offensive coordinator Cody Worley is expected to be the next head coach at Furman, sources told ESPN.","published":"2026-11-17T19:52:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512672/army-oc-worley-furman-head-coach","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Former Iowa State AD calls NIL system 'money laundering'","description":"Former Iowa State athletic director Jamie Pollard delivered a scorching appraisal of college athletics to the Knight Commission, equating NIL as a money-laundering operation.","published":"2026-11-17T19:08:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50512485/former-iowa-state-ad-calls-nil-system-money-laundering","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Purdue rolls with FAA ground stop by taking buses to Iowa","description":"Unable to travel by plane, the Boilermakers rolled with the situation and found some good times on the way.","published":"2026-11-17T11:28:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50504665/purdue-faa-ground-stop-bus-iowa","type":"Story","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Heisman of Week 11: Duke's Nate Sheppard has entered the running","description":"In a season in which star running backs seem to be popping up out of nowhere, the Blue Devils' sophomore stands out.","published":"2026-11-17T14:55:53.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503621/heisman-watch-week-11-duke-nate-sheppard","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on College Football Playoff bubble ahead of committee's third ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-17T15:58:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503628/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-third-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Breaking down the major futures for the Big Ten, from the Heisman to the CFP","description":"Let's evaluate whether a standout performance on a three-loss team and a 10-0 team are real or a mirage in the Big Ten.","published":"2026-11-17T13:02:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50504671/college-football-heisman-trophy-cfp-futures-betting-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Arkansas State tells Butch Jones he's out at end of year","description":"Arkansas State has informed football coach Butch Jones that he's out at the end of the season, sources told ESPN's Pete Thamel on Monday night.","published":"2026-11-17T02:45:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50506952/sources-butch-jones-arkansas-state-coach","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-16T23:15:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4870622/drayk-bowen","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drayk_Bowen"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Drayk Bowen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drayk_Bowen","description":"American football and baseball player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:27Z","intro":"Drayk Hudson Bowen (born April 29, 2004) is an American college football linebacker for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Bowen attended Andrean High School in Merrillville, Indiana. He played both linebacker and running back in high school. As a senior in 2022, he had 144 tackles, five sacks and three interceptions as a linebacker and rushed for 1,784 yards with 26 touchdowns as a running back. Bowen won the Butkus Award, given to the top high school linebacker in the country, and was named the Post-Tribune Football Player of the Year. He was also named the Indiana Gatorade Football Player of the Year his junior and senior seasons. For his career, he had 379 tackles, 16 tackles, six interceptions, 2,969 rushing yards and 49 touchdowns.\nBowen was selected to play in the 2023 All-American Bowl, where he was named their Defensive Player of the Year. He committed to the University of Notre Dame to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Notre Dame in 2023, Bowen played in 12 games and had 14 tackles. In the spring 2024, he appeared in three games for the baseball team. As a sophomore in 2024, he took over as a starting linebacker. He retired from baseball before the 2025 season."}]}}